,p_help_text=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'<h3>When to use</h3>',
'<p>Use this pattern to filter records and explore matching results chronologically. It suits use cases such as reviewing tasks, milestones, or activities by date, responsible person, and status, then opening a record for details.</p>',
'',
'<h3>About this pattern page</h3>',
'<p>Search matches task name, assignee, or status. The Month facet supports multiple calendar-month ranges based on task start dates. Status and Assigned To checkbox facets allow multiple selections. The Timeline presents matching tasks with dates, as'
||'signees, and colored status badges. Task titles open details; assignee links filter by person. Reset clears all selections.</p>'))
,p_page_comment=>'Timeline filters tasks using START_DATE. The Month facet supplies named calendar-month ranges with inclusive first-of-month and exclusive next-month boundaries. Keep the sample-task LOV to 25 months (12 before and after the current month) to bound th'
||'e generated facet-count query. Months with no matching tasks are hidden.'
,p_page_component_map=>'22'
);
