,p_help_text=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'<h3>When to use</h3>',
'<p>Use this pattern to filter records and review both matching details and aggregate summaries. It suits use cases such as exploring a workforce, inventory, or service portfolio where counts and charts help reveal the distribution of the filtered res'
||'ults.</p>',
'',
'<h3>About this pattern page</h3>',
'<p>Search matches employee details. Job, Cost Center, Employment Status, and Work Arrangement facets support multiple selections. Choices within a facet match any selected value; different facets combine to narrow results. The Classic Report lists ma'
||'tching employees, metric cards summarize employee, job-role, and cost-center counts, and donut charts show their distribution. All summaries reflect the complete filtered result set, not just the current report page. Reset clears all selections.</p>'))
,p_page_component_map=>'22'
);
